"Sent to the consumer when the merchant accepts, refunds or completes a "
"withdrawal."
msgstr ""
"Inviata al consumatore quando il venditore accetta, rimborsa o completa un "
"recesso."

#: src/Email/WithdrawalStatusUpdateEmail.php:67
