#: src/Frontend/BlockCheckoutConsents.php:235
msgid ""
"Whether the service-start consent (Article 14(4)(a)) applies to this cart."
msgstr "Indica se il consenso all’avvio del servizio (art. 14(4)(a)) si applica a questo carrello."

